  "description": "Today in Underscore_, I was able to interview Emmanuel Macron on the sidelines of the AI Summit. We talked about the 109 billion in announced investments, the sovereign cloud, the lack of French capital, the future of education, etc.\\n\\n👀 Not to be missed, our interview: https://youtu.be/2pFdfjz7wNc\\n\\n---\\n\\nSubscribing is the best way to support our work: https://bit.ly/3xqS2pi\\n🎥 Follow the show live: https://www.twitch.tv/Micode (every other Wednesday at 7pm)\\n🎙 The full show is available as a podcast: https://underscoretalk.netlify.app/\\n🐦 Announcements: https://twitter.com/UnderscoreTalk\\n\\n---\\n\\nEditor-in-chief - Michaël de Marliave\\nWriter - Matthieu Lambda\\nDirector - Thibault Fotré\\nEditing - Léo Legendre\\nAgent - Julie Jouanne\\nProject manager - Charles-Antoine d'Adhémar\\nProduction director: Maud Le Bonhomme\\nDirector of photography: Stanislas Cadeo\\nCamera operators: Mathieu Lam, Nicolas Fradet, Mathieu Monconduit, Thibault Guieu\\nGaffer: Amaury Brege\\nElectrician: Max Moret\\nSound engineer: Baptiste Barboiron\\nProduction manager: Mamadou Wadiou\\nMakeup artist: Kim Desnoyers\\nQLP production",
